        "aura",
        "light"
      ],
      "description": "<p>20 feet. A will-o'-wisp is itself naturally invisible, but glows with a colored light, casting bright light in the aura and making it visible. An Ancient Wisp can appear as a tiny pinpoint of light.</p>",
